      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Both RBD and CephFS drivers are enabled with CSI host networking; plugin DaemonSets carry a toleration for node-role.feather/storage so they can land on dedicated storage nodes, and every sidecar has explicit resource requests/limits."
    },
